### 1. Normalna pretraga (Radi normalno)
GET http://localhost:5294/api/users/SearchSecure?username=adnan

### 2. SQL Injection Napad na Secure by design metodu 
# Haker ne dobija nista, sistem ga tretira doslovno kao ime "admin' OR '1'='1"
GET http://localhost:5294/api/users/SearchSecure?username=admin' OR '1'='1

### 3. SQL Injection Napad - AKTIVACIJA INCIDENT RESPONSE-A
# Da nema Middleware, ovaj zahtjev bi vratio bazu, ali naš Incident Response sistem ga blokira
GET http://localhost:5294/api/users/SearchVulnerable?username=admin' OR '1'='1

### 4. Maliciozna komanda (Brisi tabelu) - ISTO BLOKIRANO
GET http://localhost:5294/api/users/SearchVulnerable?username=DROP TABLE Users